On 23.08.2018 14:25, Thomas Huth wrote:
> We can re-use the s390-ccw bios code to implement a small firmware
> for a s390x guest which prints out the "A" and "B" characters and
> modifies the memory, as required for the migration test.
That's neat and looks sane to me. We just have to remember to build
every now and then to not leave it in a miserable state after some
severe changes to pc-bios.

